    {
      "slug": "gram:n3-tatoe-temo",
      "variants": [],
      "steps_unavailable": "Circumfix around a fixed pre-clause adverb: たとえ sits BEFORE the clause and the op enum has no prepend operation. Any single sequence would emit only the ても half - 降っても / 寒くても / 静かであっても - which is the plain ても concessive (gram:n3-temo, same batch), not this point; emitting it under this label would teach the wrong pattern. Same decision as gram:n3-donna-ni-temo. (Record defect noted separately: this point's structure_pattern field contains an editing instruction instead of a value.)",
